  "theory": "<h3>📌 Члены семьи</h3><table border='1' cellpadding='10' style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;'><tr style='background: #3B6FE0; color: white;'><th>Русский</th><th>Немецкий</th></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>отец</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>der Vater</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>мать</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>die Mutter</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>брат</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>der Bruder</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>сестра</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>die Schwester</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>сын</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>der Sohn</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>дочь</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>die Tochter</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>ребёнок</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>das Kind</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>дедушка</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>der Großvater</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>бабушка</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>die Großmutter</span></td></tr></table><h3>📌 Притяжательные местоимения (Nominativ)</h3><table border='1' cellpadding='10' style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;'><tr style='background: #3B6FE0; color: white;'><th>Местоимение</th><th>Мужской род</th><th>Женский род</th><th>Средний род</th></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>ich</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>mein</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>meine</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>mein</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>du</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>dein</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>deine</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>dein</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>er</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>sein</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>seine</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>sein</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>sie (она)</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>ihr</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>ihre</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>ihr</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>wir</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>unser</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>unsere</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>unser</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>ihr (вы)</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>euer</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>eure</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>euer</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>sie/Sie</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>ihr</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>ihre</span></td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>ihr</span></td></tr></table><div class='info-box' style='background: #E8F0FE; padding: 15px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 15px 0;'><strong>🎯 ВАЖНО!</strong><br>Окончание притяжательного местоимения зависит от рода существительного:<br><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>mein Vater</span> (м.р.), <span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>meine Mutter</span> (ж.р.), <span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>mein Kind</span> (ср.р.)</div><h3>📌 Глагол haben (иметь)</h3><p>Спряжение глагола <strong>haben</strong>:</p><table border='1' cellpadding='10' style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;'><tr style='background: #3B6FE0; color: white;'><th>Местоимение</th><th>Форма</th></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>ich</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>habe</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>du</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>hast</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>er/sie/es</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>hat</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>wir</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>haben</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #E3F2FD;'><td>ihr</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>habt</span></td></tr><tr style='background: #F5F5F5;'><td>sie/Sie</td><td><span style='color:#2E7D32;font-weight:bold;'>haben</span></td></tr></table>",
